    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFor Sale By Public Auction\nFriday 2nd October, 2026 at 2.30 p.m.\nSika Room, Killarney Plaza Hotel, V93 X3VW\n\nSet on a generous site of approximately 1.3 acres, this four-bedroom residence presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a property with tremendous potential. While requiring complete modernisation, the property offers spacious accommodation and an idyllic setting in the heart of Mid Kerry.\nConveniently located close to Firies, Farranfore, Castlemaine and Milltown, the property enjoys easy access to both Killarney and Tralee, each just a 20-minute drive away. Kerry Airport and Farranfore train station are also within 10 minutes, providing excellent connectivity.\nThe accommodation comprises living room, diningroom, kitchen, sunroom, utility room, shower room, living room, two ground-floor bedrooms and a wet room. The first floor accommodates a further two bedrooms.Externally, the property benefits from a large detached garage and extensive grounds, offering ample space for a variety of uses, subject to the necessary consents.Qualifies for grants up to 50,000 under the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant. https://www.gov.ie/en/service/f8f1b-vacant-property-refurbishment-grant/# Also may qualify for the SEAI One Stop Shop Grant.https://www.seai.ie/grants/home-energy-grants/one-stop-shop/ \nCombining a convenient location with a substantial site and enormous scope for refurbishment, this property represents a rare opportunity to create a superb family home in a highly accessible Mid Kerry setting. Viewing is recommended.\n\nSolicitor:- Noreen Broderick\nTerence F. Casey & Company\n55 Main Street\nCastleisland\nCo. Kerry\nT; 066 7141211"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround floor: - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - 3.5 x 3.4\nFireplace\n\nDining room - 5 x 4\n\n\nKitchen - 3.6 x 2.61\n\n\nSunroom - 4.8 x 3.5\nSouth facing.\n\nUtility Room - 3.5 x 1.5\n\n\nShower room - 2.4 x 1.2\n\n\nBedroom One - 3.24 x 3.67\n\n\nBedroom Two - 4.6 x 3.16\n\n\nShower/wet room - 1.8 xc 2.3\nShower, wc, wash hand basin\n\nFirst floor: - \n\n\nLanding - \nLinen closet/hotpress, access to attic storage\n\nBedroom Three - 2.7 x 3.9\n\n\nBedroom Four - 3.4 x 3.8\n\n\nOutbuildings: - \n\n\nDetached garage - \n\n\nArea: House: - 120 sq.m./1,291 sq. ft.\n\n\nGarage: - 31 sq.m./ 373 sq. ft.\n\n\n"
